Out late in Japan? Ask this before you miss the last train 🚃
Many lines stop around midnight.

Today's phrases:
• さいごの でんしゃ (saigo no densha) = Last train
• なんじですか (nanji desu ka) = What time is it?
• いそいで ください (isoide kudasai) = Please hurry

